Usage: near transaction construct-transaction receiver-id add-action [COMMAND]

Commands:
  transfer                Specify data for transfer tokens
  function-call           Specify data to call the function
  stake                   Specify data to stake NEAR Tokens
  create-account          Specify data to create a sub-account
  delete-account          Specify data to delete an account
  add-key                 Specify the data to add an access key to the account
  delete-key              Specify the data to delete the access key to the account
  deploy-contract         Specify the details to deploy the contract code
  deploy-global-contract  Specify the details to deploy the global contract code
  use-global-contract     Specify the details to use the global contract
  help                    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
